 767  8374              ; EasyCF 1.1 - rezidentni stav spolecneho systemu pro hotovy Switcher 1.1.
 768  8374              ; Full Switcher rozlisuje legacy samostatne EasyCF od systemu 1.1 podpisem
 769  8374              ; "ES11" v BSDOS page 97. EasyCF 1.1 proto po uspesne instalaci ulozi:
 770  8374              ;   ACTIVE_PAGE = 98 (CF), ACTIVE_DEVICE = 0 (CF),
 771  8374              ;   SD page/partition = 0, CF partition = 1..4, podpis = "ES11".
